density 1.0
dynamicViscosity 1.0e-5
turbulenceModel kOmega
# Strongly damp the k/omega update on startup; the high-Re wall-adjacent
# omega field otherwise dominates the first transient SIMPLE sweeps.
turbulenceRelaxation 0.01
turbulenceTolerance 1.0e-2
kOmegaBetaStar 0.09
kOmegaBeta 0.075
kOmegaGamma 0.5555555555555556
kOmegaSigmaK 0.5
kOmegaSigmaOmega 0.5
kMin 1.0e-12
omegaMin 1.0e-10
